bVTbB1YRy3GVW6lpTwjOOMDwM_O_fDPih9Dr4qX5d0I_zEHrSNP2tXE-GAicj3rkSSWdAWL-s8fVQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Modifying code for cross-platform compatibility**\\n\\nI recognize that I need to modify the code in `main.py` to ensure it works across platforms. I'll implement changes to set up the skill directory using `pathlib` for clarity. The plan's to maintain a fallback for the Linux path and use `sys.executable` for executing Python commands. I'll make sure the modifications are included near the top of the `run_akshare_query` function, ensuring everything aligns properly while keeping it clean and functional.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Implementing skill path function**\\n\\nI'm working on the function to get the akshare skill path. I need to define the current directory and calculate the workspace directory based on the script's location. Since the script is in `skills/akshare-wrapper`, I need to navigate up one level to reach the `skills` directory. This means I should use `os.path.dirname(current_dir)` to get the `workspace_dir`.\\n\\nTo find the correct path for `new-akshare-stock`, I'll join it with `workspace/skills`. So, I need to make sure I structure the candidates correctly!\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying directory paths**\\n\\nI'm figuring out how to correctly set the base directory and skills directory in the script. I’ve realized that using `os.path.abspath(__file__)` gives me the full path to the script, so when I call `os.path.dirname` three times, I finally get to the workspace root. However, I only need to reach the skills directory, which is two levels up.\\n\\nTo accomplish this, I'll create `skills_root` by calling `os.path.dirname` twice on `os.path.abspath(__file__)`. Then, I can construct the candidate path for `new-akshare-stock`. Lastly, I’ll ensure to set the command to use `sys.executable` for consistency.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Implementing skill path resolution**\\n\\nI’m working on creating a `resolve_skill_path` function to keep things tidy and avoid repetition. My plan is to define it near the `run_akshare_query` function, and perhaps include an import for `pathlib`. However, I can stick with `os` for this.\\n\\nThe function will check a list of candidate paths, starting from the base skill directory derived from `__file__`. If any of the candidate directories exist, it returns that path; otherwise, it falls back to the last candidate.\\n\\nIn `run_akshare_query`, I’ll then call the `resolve_skill_path` function to set up the skill path and prepare the command with `sys.executable`. Now, let's make those edits!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_cahxkC0Xdq9q5nppFhD5S1nd|fc_0de9960c354c34a00069bb5d04c754819390e1df8e9348c097","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"skills/akshare-wrapper/main.py","oldText":"def run_akshare_query(query: str, platform: str = \"qq\") -> str:\n    \"\"\"执行akshare查询\n    \n    Args:\n        query: 自然语言查询\n        platform: 输出平台格式 (qq/telegram)\n    \n    Returns:\n        格式化后的查询结果\n    \"\"\"\n    skill_path = \"/root/.openclaw/skills/akshare-stock\"\n    cmd = [\"python3\", \"main.py\", \"--query\", query, \"--platform\", platform]\n    \n    # 设置超时时间（根据查询类型调整）\n    timeout = 15\n    if any(keyword in query for keyword in [\"港股\", \"美股\", \"可转债\", \"基金\"]):\n        timeout = 25  # 跨市场查询更慢\n","newText":"def resolve_skill_path() -> str:\n    \"\"\"Resolve the akshare-stock skill installation path.\"\"\"\n    base_dir = os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)))\n    candidates = [\n        os.path.join(base_dir, \"new-akshare-stock\"),\n        os.path.join(base_dir, \"akshare-stock\"),\n        os.path.join(os.path.expanduser(\"~\"), \".openclaw\", \"skills\", \"akshare-stock\"),\n        \"/root/.openclaw/skills/akshare-stock\",\n    ]\n    for path in candidates:\n        if os.path.isdir(path):\n            return path\n    return candidates[-1]\n\n\ndef run_akshare_query(query: str, platform: str = \"qq\") -> str:\n    \"\"\"执行akshare查询\n    \n    Args:\n        query: 自然语言查询\n        platform: 输出平台格式 (qq/telegram)\n    \n    Returns:\n        格式化后的查询结果\n    \"\"\"\n    skill_path = resolve_skill_path()\n    cmd = [sys.executable, \"main.py\", \"--query\", query, \"--platform\", platform]\n    \n    # 设置超时时间（根据查询类型调整）\n    timeout = 15\n    if any(keyword in query for keyword in [\"港股\", \"美股\", \"可转债\", \"基金\"]):\n        timeout = 25  # 跨市场查询更慢\n"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"skills/akshare-wrapper/main.py\",\"oldText\":\"def run_akshare_query(query: str, platform: str = \\\"qq\\\") -> str:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"执行akshare查询\\n    \\n    Args:\\n        query: 自然语言查询\\n        platform: 输出平台格式 (qq/telegram)\\n    \\n    Returns:\\n        格式化后的查询结果\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    skill_path = \\\"/root/.openclaw/skills/akshare-stock\\\"\\n    cmd = [\\\"python3\\\", \\\"main.py\\\", \\\"--query\\\", query, \\\"--platform\\\", platform]\\n    \\n    # 设置超时时间（根据查询类型调整）\\n    timeout = 15\\n    if any(keyword in query for keyword in [\\\"港股\\\", \\\"美股\\\", \\\"可转债\\\", \\\"基金\\\"]):\\n        timeout = 25  # 跨市场查询更慢\\n\",\"newText\":\"def resolve_skill_path() -> str:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Resolve the akshare-stock skill installation path.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    base_dir = os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)))\\n    candidates = [\\n        os.path.join(base_dir, \\\"new-akshare-stock\\\"),\\n        os.path.join(base_dir, \\\"akshare-stock\\\"),\\n        os.path.join(os.path.expanduser(\\\"~\\\"), \\\".openclaw\\\", \\\"skills\\\", \\\"akshare-stock\\\"),\\n        \\\"/root/.openclaw/skills/akshare-stock\\\",\\n    ]\\n    for path in candidates:\\n        if os.path.isdir(path):\\n            return path\\n    return candidates[-1]\\n\\n\\ndef run_akshare_query(query: str, platform: str = \\\"qq\\\") -> str:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"执行akshare查询\\n    \\n    Args:\\n        query: 自然语言查询\\n        platform: 输出平台格式 (qq/telegram)\\n    \\n    Returns:\\n        格式化后的查询结果\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    skill_path = resolve_skill_path()\\n    cmd = [sys.executable, \\\"main.py\\\", \\\"--query\\\", query, \\\"--platform\\\", platform]\\n    \\n    # 设置超时时间（根据查询类型调整）\\n    timeout = 15\\n    if any(keyword in query for keyword in [\\\"港股\\\", \\\"美股\\\", \\\"可转债\\\", \\\"基金\\\"]):\\n        timeout = 25  # 跨市场查询更慢\\n\"}"}],"api":"azure-openai-responses","provider":"azure-openai-responses","model":"gpt-5.1-codex-mini","usage":{"input":196,"output":2414,"cacheRead":18688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21298,"cost":{"input":0.000049,"output":0.004828,"cacheRead":0.0004672,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0053441999999999995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773886670500}}
